# Project Operational Rules

This file defines authoritative policies (“WHAT must be done”).
For rationale (“WHY”) see `CLAUDE.md`.
For execution workflow (“HOW”) see `AGENT_CHECKLIST.md`.

If any conflict arises: **.rules > CLAUDE.md > AGENT_CHECKLIST.md**.

---

## Document Map

| Purpose | File / Directory |
|---------|------------------|
| Policies & enforcement | `.rules` |
| Design & modeling rationale | `.claude/CLAUDE.md` |
| Iteration workflow steps | `.claude/AGENT_CHECKLIST.md` |
| Per-entity method plan tables | `.claude/examples/method-tables/` |
| Backlog / roadmap items | `.claude/TODO.md` |
| Terraform usage examples | `.claude/examples/terraform/` |
| OpenAPI contract | `.claude/examples/openapi.yaml` |
